{% doc %}
  @prompt
    I need a section that compares subscription vs one time order. It needs to be a block divided 50/50 in space on the vertical axis and have an image for each and copy below it, ideally in table form that one can understand at a glance "this is with subscription, this is with OPT". You can also make your own draft choices based around good practice for this, Let's make sure this ties into global css on the styling level, it looks different in styling right now, especially headlines, Styling looks better, at least correct font. The heading (choose what works for you) seems to have the wrong class, as it is quite small. I think it needs to be an h3, Still small, check if anything else limits the size of the heading, and if not go to a h2 , I need a button at the bottom of each section that allows to follow each of the two paths, I need a button at the bottom of each section that allows to follow each of the two paths. Please keep all the content that I have already added to the section.
{% enddoc %}
{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Subscription versus one-time order comparison with two pathway buttons.
{% enddoc %}
{%- comment -%}
  Styling comes from the Concept theme:
  - side margins: the theme's .page-width container
  - heading, text, badges, buttons: the theme's own classes
  - colours, borders, radius, spacing: theme variables (--color-*, --rounded-block, --sp-*)
  - vertical spacing: the parent section's padding settings, like every other section
  Only the two-column card layout is custom.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase -%}
{%- assign c = 'ai-order-compare-' | append: ai_gen_id -%}

{% style %}
  .{{ c }} { display: block; margin-block: 0; }
  /* If the parent section already applies .page-width, don't add the gutters twice. */
  .page-width .{{ c }}.page-width { padding-inline: 0; max-width: none; }

  .{{ c }}__head { align-items: center; text-align: center; margin-block-end: var(--sp-8); }

  .{{ c }}__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(var(--sp-4), 1.5vw, var(--sp-6));
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .{{ c }}__card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: rgb(var(--color-foreground) / 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border));
    border-radius: var(--rounded-block);
  }
  .{{ c }}__card--featured { border-color: rgb(var(--color-foreground) / 0.6); }

  .{{ c }}__media {
    margin: 0;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: rgb(var(--color-placeholder));
  }
  .{{ c }}__media img,
  .{{ c }}__media svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }

  .{{ c }}__body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    gap: var(--sp-3);
    padding: var(--sp-5) var(--sp-6) var(--sp-6);
  }
  .{{ c }}__body .badge { align-self: flex-start; }
  /* Light outlined pill on the one-time card; the featured card keeps the theme's solid badge. */
  .{{ c }}__card:not(.{{ c }}__card--featured) .badge {
    --badge-background: rgb(var(--color-background));
    --badge-foreground: rgb(var(--color-foreground) / 0.75);
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border));
  }
  .{{ c }}__description { margin: 0; }

  .{{ c }}__list { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .{{ c }}__item {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--sp-2d5);
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding-block: var(--sp-3);
    border-block-start: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border));
  }
  .{{ c }}__item:last-child { border-block-end: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border)); }
  .{{ c }}__icon { flex: 0 0 1.125em; width: 1.125em; height: 1.125em; margin-block-start: 0.2em; }

  .{{ c }}__foot { margin-block-start: auto; padding-block-start: var(--sp-4); }
  .{{ c }}__foot .button { width: 100%; }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .{{ c }}__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .{{ c }}__body { padding: var(--sp-4) var(--sp-5) var(--sp-5); }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="{{ c }} page-width" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
    <div class="{{ c }}__head title-wrapper leading-none flex flex-col gap-4 relative z-1">
      <h2 class="heading title-md">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="{{ c }}__grid">
    {%- for i in (1..2) -%}
      {%- if i == 1 -%}
        {%- assign card_image = block.settings.subscription_image -%}
        {%- assign card_label = block.settings.subscription_label -%}
        {%- assign card_title = block.settings.subscription_title -%}
        {%- assign card_description = block.settings.subscription_description -%}
        {%- assign card_points = block.settings.subscription_points | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
        {%- assign card_link = block.settings.subscription_link -%}
        {%- assign card_button = block.settings.subscription_button -%}
        {%- assign card_featured = true -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- assign card_image = block.settings.one_time_image -%}
        {%- assign card_label = block.settings.one_time_label -%}
        {%- assign card_title = block.settings.one_time_title -%}
        {%- assign card_description = block.settings.one_time_description -%}
        {%- assign card_points = block.settings.one_time_points | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
        {%- assign card_link = block.settings.one_time_link -%}
        {%- assign card_button = block.settings.one_time_button -%}
        {%- assign card_featured = false -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      <article class="{{ c }}__card{% if card_featured %} {{ c }}__card--featured{% endif %}">
        <figure class="{{ c }}__media">
          {%- if card_image != blank -%}
            {%- assign card_alt = card_image.alt | default: card_title -%}
            {{ card_image | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: '(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw', widths: '400,600,800,1000,1200', alt: card_alt }}
          {%- else -%}
            {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder-svg' }}
          {%- endif -%}
        </figure>

        <div class="{{ c }}__body">
          {%- if card_label != blank -%}
            <p class="badge font-medium leading-none rounded-full">{{ card_label | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if card_title != blank -%}
            <h3 class="heading text-xl leading-tight">{{ card_title | escape }}</h3>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if card_description != blank -%}
            <p class="{{ c }}__description text-opacity leading-normal">{{ card_description | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}

          <ul class="{{ c }}__list">
            {%- for point in card_points -%}
              {%- assign point_text = point | strip_html | strip -%}
              {%- if point_text != blank -%}
                <li class="{{ c }}__item leading-normal">
                  <svg class="{{ c }}__icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                  <span>{{ point_text | escape }}</span>
                </li>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>

          {%- if card_link != blank and card_button != blank -%}
            <div class="{{ c }}__foot">
              <a class="button {% if card_featured %}button--primary{% else %}button--secondary{% endif %} button--md" href="{{ card_link }}" is="hover-link">
                <span class="btn-fill" data-fill></span>
                <span class="btn-text">{{ card_button | escape }}</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </article>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Order comparison",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Choose what works for you" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Top and bottom spacing come from the section's padding settings. Side margins follow the site's page width." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Subscription" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "subscription_image", "label": "Image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "subscription_label", "label": "Label", "default": "Best for regular deliveries" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "subscription_title", "label": "Title", "default": "Subscribe and save" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "subscription_description", "label": "Description", "default": "Set a delivery rhythm that fits your home and enjoy the convenience of recurring orders." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "subscription_points", "label": "Benefits (one per line)", "default": "Set your preferred delivery frequency\nManage or skip upcoming orders\nConvenient recurring deliveries" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "subscription_button", "label": "Button text", "default": "Explore subscriptions" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "subscription_link", "label": "Button link" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "One-time order" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "one_time_image", "label": "Image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "one_time_label", "label": "Label", "default": "A single purchase" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "one_time_title", "label": "Title", "default": "Order one time" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "one_time_description", "label": "Description", "default": "Choose a one-time order when you want to shop as needed, with no recurring deliveries." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "one_time_points", "label": "Details (one per line)", "default": "Checkout once when you need it\nNo recurring delivery schedule\nGreat for trying something new" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "one_time_button", "label": "Button text", "default": "Shop one-time orders" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "one_time_link", "label": "Button link" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Order comparison" }],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "order-comparison-block"
}
{% endschema %}
